   "text": "Thanks, Victor. You're verified.\n\nI checked order Q-7801 from Taqueria Luz. It was promised for 6:15 PM and handed to you at 6:45 PM, so it was 30 minutes late. Under our policy, an order that late gets account credit equal to the delivery fee, which is $2.99 here.\n\nAn earlier support agent already issued that $2.99 credit to your account at 7:07 PM today. Because that covers the problem, I can't add a second credit for the same delay. Late deliveries are compensated with account credit only, not a refund to your card.\n\nIs there anything else I can help with, like a missing or incorrect item in the order?"
