   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Yes, the $2.99 credit is already on your account. It came from your chat around 7 PM.\n\nI understand that it doesn't feel like much for a 30-minute wait. But the compensation for a delivery 16 to 44 minutes late is a credit equal to the delivery fee, and you've received that. I can't add anything beyond it, because I can't give extra credits or goodwill gestures that the policy doesn't cover.\n\nIf something else was wrong with the order, such as a missing or incorrect item, tell me and I'll check it. You can also ask me to pass your case to a human specialist if you'd like."
